{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "获得了活动基础的２－Ｔ班同学的同意之后──", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“事情就是这样，拜托大家了。”", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "ar3184", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以我和爱理为中心，正式展开了全校规模的连署活动。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为距离休业式没剩几天了，应该会很辛苦……”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系的。那么我就负责３年级生，寻找愿意协助我们的人。”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 218, "voice": "mu0303", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜！”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "pn0094", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，小熊喵也一起喔！”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 218, "voice": "mu0304", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我负责１年级生。”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 213, "voice": "sk0641", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我就负责２年级其他的班级了，不过我这么受欢迎，应该是没问题。”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 217, "voice": "sn0206", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我去问问看学生会愿不愿意协助吧～”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "ht0252", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家各自确定了不同的方向，希望组成协力合作的体制。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我来问问老师们好了……啊啊，还有对学园长的保密。”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 201, "voice": "mc0182", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……果然必须对那个人保密才行吗？”", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，好像在打游击战一样呢……在递出连署前不保密的话，她好像会闹脾气。”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 201, "voice": "mc0183", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“想要突然递出连署让妈妈吓一跳。不好意思这部分就麻烦你了，八冢老师。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "ar3185", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好的，我知道了。我会加油的濑名同学。”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 201, "voice": "mc0184", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么连署用的纸本和准备各种用具就交给本人安洁吧～～♪”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": "ag0593", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学校方面，交给万智老师。后援的工作则由安洁负责。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然了，班上的同学也答应会尽量空出时间协助我们──", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "ar3186", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“再次感谢大家！”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "ar3187", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……怎么说呢，感觉产生了信心。", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这全部都是因为想支持爱理的样子。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是说啊～”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": "ag0594", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在前往印刷室途中，安洁雀跃地笑着说。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“老实说，之前的她是那种根本不需要人出手帮忙的感觉。”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": "ag0595", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈哈……现在则是个傻傻的女孩子。”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾同学说的没错。”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 207, "voice": "ag0596", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……当时就那样说出口了。”", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "根本没有看场面气氛。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是……不知道为什么，胸口有一股亢奋感。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
